TO_CLOB('How does the security protocols protect data?'),
TO_CLOB('These protocols protect data in 3 key ways:\r 1. Authentication ensures that you are communicating with the bank only and protects impersonation by another computer\r 2. Encryption scrambles transferred data so that it cannot be read by unauthorized parties\r 3. Data integrity, in terms of data and network security, assures that information can only be accessed and modified by those authorized to do so.'),
